WEBVTT

00:09:59.876 --> 00:10:02.415
and it will go a bit crazy,
sort of blow a raspberry,

00:10:02.439 --> 00:10:05.853
and then it will go back to its resting
potential when we stop the odor.

00:10:05.877 --> 00:10:12.860
(Rapid crackling)

00:10:12.884 --> 00:10:18.979
(Low-pitch crackling)

00:10:19.003 --> 00:10:25.532
(Rapid crackling)

00:10:25.556 --> 00:10:26.707
OK, there we go,

00:10:26.731 --> 00:10:30.512
so you can go home now and say
that you've seen an insect smelling